++ | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
++@@ -22,28 +38,32 @@ Reference receipts (`docs/ew/receipts/performance-*.json`, Platinum 8573C, 8 log
++ | Sensor-only | 2.00 / 2.90 | 2.20 / 8.80 | 0.10 / 1.10 | full-pass fail |
++ | EW final | 2.00 / 3.30 | 2.50 / 6.90 | 0.20 / 4.50 | full-pass fail |
